        <mxCell id="notes2" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes (measured on 8 GiB of data, 2026-09-04, ONTAP 9.18.1P3D1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 &lt;b&gt;A metadata operation, not a copy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The SNAPSHOT phase creates a volume Snapshot: 44s for 8 GiB. Growth against data volume was measured at one point only&lt;br&gt;*2 &lt;b&gt;Finalize is the point of peak capacity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The split takes the clone from 35.5 MiB to 8.57 GiB physical. One extra copy of the migrated data is required&lt;br&gt;*3 &lt;b&gt;The gap before staging is deleted&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;About 9 minutes after the split completes. Both volumes hold physical capacity in that window (about 16.6 GiB total)&lt;br&gt;*4 &lt;b&gt;The split is non-disruptive&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mounts held, sha256 matched, and zero I/O errors or path-down events" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#F5F5F5;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
